WEBVTT

00:07:59.288 --> 00:08:01.288
to ensure their children
are getting access

00:08:01.329 --> 00:08:05.163
to the vital early education
our children need.

00:08:05.163 --> 00:08:07.996
A world where we can walk
around our neighborhoods

00:08:08.038 --> 00:08:11.829
and tour a Spanish immersion program,
a fully outdoor program,

00:08:11.871 --> 00:08:14.079
a science-based program

00:08:14.079 --> 00:08:15.538
and make a choice.

00:08:15.913 --> 00:08:18.246
It's during these early years

00:08:18.288 --> 00:08:21.454
children learn to speak,

00:08:21.454 --> 00:08:22.829
they learn to communicate,

00:08:22.871 --> 00:08:24.788
they learn teamwork,

00:08:24.829 --> 00:08:27.621
they learn what it's like
to start something and fail

00:08:27.663 --> 00:08:29.288
and try again.

00:08:29.329 --> 00:08:33.246
A lot of the skills I use as a CEO
today, running my company,